ge and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"noise-blast","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","sonic"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":10},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d10","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"sonic"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DtctvEPiB4FbS2nw","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.wzLkNU3AAqOSKFPR","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"FTTplvv5uPQZ2NUP"},{"folder":"4fJHnYFqH0VjZXPv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/paralyze.webp","name":"Paralyze","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You block the target's motor impulses before they can leave its mind, threatening to freeze the target in place. The target must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Paralyzed for 4 rounds. At the end of each of its turns, it can attempt a new Will save to reduce the remaining duration by 1 round, or end it entirely on a critical success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"paralyze","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","incapacitation","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DtctvEPiB4FbS2nw","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"7":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.DCQHaLrYXMI37dvW","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"Ob5Nb1VxzNLUwU7g"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/blur.webp","name":"Blur","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target's form appears blurry. It becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}. As the nature of this effect still leaves the target's location obvious, the target can't use this concealment to Hide or Sneak.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"blur","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate","visual"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DtctvEPiB4FbS2nw","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.3JG1t3T4mWn6vTke","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"QZEZo8rEnwUSeNDp"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/fire/orb-vortex.webp","name":"Noise Blast","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is deafened for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"noise-blast","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","sonic"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":10},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d10","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"sonic"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DtctvEPiB4FbS2nw","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"area":0,"damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.wzLkNU3AAqOSKFPR","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"ZAaUUYoQJuWeJUVJ"},{"type":"spell","name":"Songshroud","folder":"xwlynqyv21iphGTr","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You surround yourself in a beautiful melody that echoes in unusual directions, confounding attempts to hear your precise location. While using songshroud, you can't become unnoticed by creatures that can hear. You are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to creatures that rely purely on echolocation or other sound-based senses, and you can't become observed by those senses unless they use magic or another special ability and succeed at a counteract check against this spell; as such, you can use songshroud in combination with becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} (or foiling vision in a different way) to avoid being observed by a creature with both vision and echolocation. The shroud also protects you from harmful sounds, granting you a +1 status bonus to saving throws against auditory effects and resistance 5 to sonic damage. When you speak, you can choose to either project your voice normally or to use the song to hide it. If you choose to hide it, creatures that are farther than 5 feet away must succeed at a Perception check against your spell DC to overhear what you are saying.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.h0eng2GtJpOuRndn]{Spell Effect: Songshroud}</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The resistance to sonic damage increases to 10, the duration increases to 10 minutes, and the status bonus on saving throws against auditory effects increases to +2.</p><p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The resistance to sonic damage increases to 15, the duration increases to 10 minutes, and the status bonus on saving throws against auditory effects increases to +3.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","sonic"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"DtctvEPiB4FbS2nw","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"img":"icons/magic/sonic/explosion-shock-sound-wave.webp","effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.spells.Item.PF3gWKYvNgb56kaI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"hQ77L7ZQtbB3XjUj"},{"name":"Arcane Focus Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{